for anything?

00:09:48.988 --> 00:09:52.992
I can't even get 75% approval
from my crew

00:09:52.992 --> 00:09:54.493
for my impression
of Michael Shannon

00:09:54.493 --> 00:09:56.695
playing various
Looney Tune characters.

00:09:56.695 --> 00:09:58.197
[ As Shannon/Bugs Bunny ]
Get ready to die, [bleep],

00:09:58.197 --> 00:10:01.066
because it's duck season
in this part of town.

00:10:01.066 --> 00:10:03.903
You should've made a left turn
at Albuquerque, mother[bleep].

00:10:03.903 --> 00:10:05.804
[ As Shannon/Foghorn Leghorn ]
I say!

00:10:05.804 --> 00:10:09.107
[ Laughter ]
I say, I say, boy!

00:10:09.107 --> 00:10:11.476
What is the big idea?

00:10:11.476 --> 00:10:14.746
[ Laughter ]
Are you threatening me, boy?

00:10:14.746 --> 00:10:18.651
